<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Select Appointments a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Select Appointments a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential initiated Select Appointments Holdings Plc with a buy rating, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- The British-based recruitment company went public in late November for $10.50 a share. Prudential was the lead manager of the offering. Robert W. Baird &amp; Co Inc was also an underwriter of the initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Friday at 11-7/8.</p>
</text>
